 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "1.job",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.3667,
   "text": "In this town, being scared was my job."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.zombie",
   "start": 2.3667,
   "end": 3.9667,
   "text": "There was a zombie outside my window."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.years",
   "start": 3.9667,
   "end": 5.3667,
   "text": "He had been there for two years."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.kevin",
   "start": 5.3667,
   "end": 6.4667,
   "text": "His name was Kevin."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.tag",
   "start": 6.4667,
   "end": 7.7667,
   "text": "It said so on his tag."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.scream",
   "start": 7.7667,
   "end": 10.2667,
   "text": "Every morning, I looked at Kevin, and I screamed."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.lunch",
   "start": 10.2667,
   "end": 11.1667,
   "text": "Then I had lunch."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.town",
   "start": 11.1667,
   "end": 12.8667,
   "text": "Our town was three glass rooms in the sky."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.gary",
   "start": 12.8667,
   "end": 15.0667,
   "text": "Next door was Gary. Gary screamed in his sleep."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.barb",
   "start": 15.0667,
   "end": 17.5333,
   "text": "On the other side was Barb. Barb counted."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.pop",
   "start": 17.5333,
   "end": 20.0667,
   "text": "When we were scared enough, an iron man popped out of the air."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.step",
   "start": 20.0667,
   "end": 21.0333,
   "text": "He took one step."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.water",
   "start": 21.0333,
   "end": 22.2667,
   "text": "Then the water took him away."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.talk",
   "start": 22.2667,
   "end": 24.2667,
   "text": "We did not talk about where the iron men went."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.nice",
   "start": 24.2667,
   "end": 26.2333,
   "text": "Clearly, it was somewhere nice."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.chest",
   "start": 26.2333,
   "end": 30.5,
   "text": "Under the floor, there was a chest. Iron fell into it. And flowers."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.pay",
   "start": 30.5,
   "end": 32.6,
   "text": "Clearly, the flowers were our pay."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.boss",
   "start": 32.6,
   "end": 36.1,
   "text": "Once a week, the boss came. He took the iron. He never looked up."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.problem",
   "start": 36.1,
   "end": 37.1333,
   "text": "Then there was a problem."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.long",
   "start": 37.1333,
   "end": 39.3333,
   "text": "Two years is a long time to look at one face."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.wave",
   "start": 39.3333,
   "end": 40.6,
   "text": "One morning, Kevin waved."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.back",
   "start": 40.6,
   "end": 41.5,
   "text": "I waved back."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.game",
   "start": 41.5,
   "end": 44.0667,
   "text": "After that, we played tic tac toe on the glass."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.lost",
   "start": 44.0667,
   "end": 46.3,
   "text": "Kevin never won. He did not mind."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.urr",
   "start": 46.3,
   "end": 49.3,
   "text": "He said, \"urr\". I thought it meant good morning."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.nothing",
   "start": 49.3,
   "end": 53.8,
   "text": "So one morning, I looked at Kevin, and I opened my mouth, and nothing came out."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.noiron",
   "start": 53.8,
   "end": 56.7667,
   "text": "No scream. No iron man. No iron."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.gary",
   "start": 56.7667,
   "end": 59.7,
   "text": "Gary screamed for both of us. Then Gary lost his voice."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.barb",
   "start": 59.7,
   "end": 61.1,
   "text": "Barb stopped counting."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.empty",
   "start": 61.1,
   "end": 63.2333,
   "text": "The boss opened the chest. It was empty."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.up",
   "start": 63.2333,
   "end": 64.9667,
   "text": "And for the first time, he looked up."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.atme",
   "start": 64.9667,
   "end": 66.7667,
   "text": "He looked at me. He looked at Kevin."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.left",
   "start": 66.7667,
   "end": 68.8,
   "text": "Then he left. I thought that was that."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.rope",
   "start": 68.8,
   "end": 70.8333,
   "text": "He came back with a new zombie on a rope."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.new",
   "start": 70.8333,
   "end": 73.5333,
   "text": "The new one had no tag. He did not wave."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.bucket",
   "start": 73.5333,
   "end": 75.2333,
   "text": "And for Kevin, he had a bucket."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.fire",
   "start": 75.2333,
   "end": 76.7333,
   "text": "There was no water in the bucket."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.tried",
   "start": 76.7333,
   "end": 79.4,
   "text": "I tried to scream. To show him Kevin still worked."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.hello",
   "start": 79.4,
   "end": 80.7333,
   "text": "It came out as, \"hello\"."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.eep",
   "start": 80.7333,
   "end": 82.4333,
   "text": "Gary tried. Gary went, \"eep\"."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.lift",
   "start": 82.4333,
   "end": 83.5,
   "text": "The boss lifted the bucket."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.kevin",
   "start": 83.5,
   "end": 85.7,
   "text": "Kevin looked at me, and said, \"urr\"."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.bye",
   "start": 85.7,
   "end": 87.3,
   "text": "That one did not mean good morning."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.scared",
   "start": 87.3,
   "end": 89.7667,
   "text": "And then I was scared. Not of Kevin. For Kevin."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.real",
   "start": 89.7667,
   "end": 93.1667,
   "text": "I have screamed every day for two years. That was the first real one."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.glass",
   "start": 93.1667,
   "end": 94.1333,
   "text": "The glass cracked."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.pop",
   "start": 94.1333,
   "end": 95.7,
   "text": "An iron man popped out of the air."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.barb",
   "start": 95.7,
   "end": 97.8,
   "text": "Barb said, \"nine hundred and twelve\"."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.step",
   "start": 97.8,
   "end": 98.7667,
   "text": "He took one step."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.stop",
   "start": 98.7667,
   "end": 100.6,
   "text": "And stopped. He did not go in the water."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.kevin",
   "start": 100.6,
   "end": 103.1333,
   "text": "He looked at Kevin. Iron men do not like zombies."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.said",
   "start": 103.1333,
   "end": 105.4333,
   "text": "I hit the glass. I said, \"he is with us\"."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.turn",
   "start": 105.4333,
   "end": 107.6333,
   "text": "The iron man looked at me. Then he looked at the boss."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.back",
   "start": 107.6333,
   "end": 109.0,
   "text": "The boss took one step back."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.nofloor",
   "start": 109.0,
   "end": 109.9667,
   "text": "There was no floor there."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.long",
   "start": 109.9667,
   "end": 112.2,
   "text": "It is a long way down. I counted to nine."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.quiet",
   "start": 112.2,
   "end": 113.3333,
   "text": "Then it was just us."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.broke",
   "start": 113.3333,
   "end": 115.6,
   "text": "The iron man broke the glass. He let us out."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.legs",
   "start": 115.6,
   "end": 118.0,
   "text": "Kevin got out of his boat. His legs had forgotten how."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.follow",
   "start": 118.0,
   "end": 120.4,
   "text": "I followed the water. I wanted to see the nice place."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.end",
   "start": 120.4,
   "end": 122.2,
   "text": "At the end of the water, there was fire."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.list",
   "start": 122.2,
   "end": 124.4,
   "text": "The chest. The iron. The flowers."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.count",
   "start": 124.4,
   "end": 126.0333,
   "text": "Nine hundred and eleven iron men."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.job",
   "start": 126.0333,
   "end": 127.0333,
   "text": "It was never a job."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.parts",
   "start": 127.0333,
   "end": 129.1333,
   "text": "We were not the staff. We were the machine."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.gave",
   "start": 129.1333,
   "end": 132.4,
   "text": "The iron man looked at the fire for a long time. Then he gave Barb a flower."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.edge",
   "start": 132.4,
   "end": 134.4333,
   "text": "We walked to the edge of town, and looked down."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.down",
   "start": 134.4333,
   "end": 136.1667,
   "text": "The ground is two hundred blocks away."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.have",
   "start": 136.1667,
   "end": 139.6,
   "text": "We have one iron man, one boat, and a zombie called Kevin."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.bed",
   "start": 139.6,
   "end": 141.4333,
   "text": "And far below, a bed lit up."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.sub",
   "start": 141.4333,
   "end": 144.5333,
   "text": "Like and subscribe for part two. The boss is on his way back."
  }
 ],
